text = "• Left-Mouse Click & Drag: Grab and pull any ragdoll limb, rope, slime, or banner
• Right-Mouse Click or 'C': Cut rope segment or tear banner under cursor
• Space or 'B': Drop rolling ball | 'Z': Drop 2D ragdoll
• 'W': Toggle wind blower | 'T': Toggle Tension stress heatmap
• 'R': Reset scene | '3': Switch to 3D playground | 'ESC': Pause / Resume"



